inal size; native MID alpha exposes the unchanged room floor. No neighboring counter pixels, resizing or new collision.",["credit"]="FireGold 1.4 by Tzx211; native potted flower artwork.",["map"]="GOLDENROD_DEPT_STORE_ROOF",["sourceCells"]={{2,0}},["status"]="reviewed",["style"]="gen3",["sourceUrl"]="https://www.pokecommunity.com/threads/pok%C3%A9mon-fire-gold-1-4.473130/",["base"]={["game"]="firered",["id"]=696,["hash"]="45a52aa924751238216a3e10c21836eda69bc0175c6393a0ab217a9693d6b550",["tileset"]="building__rom_082d4e6c"},["tileset"]="TILESET_MART",["assetFileHash"]="d7c42c8f2d91b284423382de5ef26eb0378486aaa452783993b284933452d193",["sourceCollision"]=7,["asset"]="assets/third_party/johto-hacks/interior-plants/firegold-potted-flower16.png",["sourceHash"]="04bf6719496e26199052a95c944ed7734ab5d4eedf6513528a545234d6dbd20d",["sourcePriority"]={false,false,false,false},["game"]="crystal"},{["compositionPixelHash"]="f12019cbfe937e34013075d61d269130f9631a4a16a1370db92bc134f788226f",["kind"]="third_party",["sourcePalettes"]={1,1,3,3},["id"]=22,["sourceFiles"]={["metadata"]="0071b3599a4bf7682f07f433f8493159d105148d8b78ff06e77817ddb044c2a5",["maps"]="210b5527393c273c632572fd697aa89bec9c853526b58069a77a2acc8767ebf0",["image"]="fa6f84007715af5bd6230d9d30bdf9eb059f1bd4b66a860d748013117a25abb4"},["role"]="johto_shop_complete_roof_planter",["quadrant"]=1,["evidence"]="Existing native FireRed Marts and department-store stock shelves, checkout register, counters, windows, directory, roof seating, vending machines, parapets and shelter modules retain their native pixel scale. Source shops, vendors, elevator destinations, stairs, roof interactions, events and collision remain unchanged. Narrow source stock displays use complete native left/right end modules; no unique machine caps or shelf feet are omitted. Replaced generated artwork with checked native Johto-hack pixels. Complete small objects and repeating structural modules use native scale or uniform integer reductions. The orig