 feet are omitted. Replaced generated artwork with checked native Johto-hack pixels. Complete small objects and repeating structural modules use native scale or uniform integer reductions. The original room base, source interactions, holes and collision remain unchanged. Complete native FireGold potted flower replaces the partial reduced flowerbox. All150flower, leaf, pot and shadow pixels retain their original size; native MID alpha exposes the unchanged room floor. No neighboring counter pixels, resizing or new collision.",["credit"]="FireGold 1.4 by Tzx211; native potted flower artwork.",["map"]="GOLDENROD_DEPT_STORE_ROOF",["sourceCells"]={{4,6},{8,6},{12,6}},["status"]="reviewed",["style"]="gen3",["sourceUrl"]="https://www.pokecommunity.com/threads/pok%C3%A9mon-fire-gold-1-4.473130/",["base"]={["game"]="firered",["id"]=696,["hash"]="45a52aa924751238216a3e10c21836eda69bc0175c6393a0ab217a9693d6b550",["tileset"]="building__rom_082d4e6c"},["tileset"]="TILESET_MART",["assetFileHash"]="d7c42c8f2d91b284423382de5ef26eb0378486aaa452783993b284933452d193",["sourceCollision"]=7,["asset"]="assets/third_party/johto-hacks/interior-plants/firegold-potted-flower16.png",["sourceHash"]="8b25bcd4963d056a187099a1de5342d052680bb4f9df94441db5397038f056e7",["sourcePriority"]={false,false,false,false},["game"]="crystal"},{["compositionPixelHash"]="f12019cbfe937e34013075d61d269130f9631a4a16a1370db92bc134f788226f",["kind"]="third_party",["sourcePalettes"]={3,3,5,5},["id"]=59,["sourceFiles"]={["metadata"]="0071b3599a4bf7682f07f433f8493159d105148d8b78ff06e77817ddb044c2a5",["maps"]="210b5527393c273c632572fd697aa89bec9c853526b58069a77a2acc8767ebf0",["image"]="fa6f84007715af5bd6230d9d30bdf9eb059f1bd4b66a860d748013117a25abb4"},["role"]="johto_shop_complete_roof_planter",["quadrant"]=1,["evidence"]="Existing native FireRed Marts and department-store stock shelves, checkout register, counters, windows, directory, roof seating, vending machines, parapets and shelter modules retain their native pix